hint: A withdrawal is refused only when the amount is **more than** the balance.
right: 20 is taken (30 left, True). 40 is more than 30, so it's refused (False) and nothing changes. 30 is not more than 30, so it's taken (True), leaving 0.
wrong: 50 → withdraw 20 → 30 (True). 40 > 30, refused (False), still 30. 30 > 30 is False, so it's taken (True) → 0.

