solution:
```python
class Dog:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name
        self.tricks = []

    def learn(self, trick):
        self.tricks.append(trick)

    def __repr__(self):
        return f"{self.name} knows {self.tricks}"

d = Dog("Rex")
d.learn("sit")
print(d)
```
