=== task: predict hard
title: Two names, one counter
code:
```python
class Counter:
    def __init__(self):
        self.n = 0

    def inc(self):
        self.n += 1
        return self

a = Counter()
b = a
c = Counter()
a.inc().inc()
b.inc()
print(a.n, b.n, c.n)
```
